      "text": "And Another Counsel for Applicant :- Narendra Gupta Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A.\nHon'ble Saurabh Lavania,J.\nHeard Shri Narendra Gupta, learned counsel for the applicant and Shri Ajay Kumar Srivastava,\nlearned A.G.A.-I for State-opposite party.\nThe instant application has been filed seeking the following main relief:-\n\"to quash/set-aside the impugned judgment and order dated 24.01.2025 passed by Sessions Judge, Sitapur in Criminal Revision No.98/2024 as well as order dated 03.07.2024 passed by Chief Judicial Magistrate, Sitapur in Criminal Misc. Case No.97/2024 (State Versus Ram Lotan) arising out of case crime no.733/2023 u/s 376, 504, 506 IPC, P.S. Kotwali District Sitapur, contained as Annexure No. 1&2 to this application.\"",
